Title: Kilmarnock fans react to win over Brora Rangers
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Gordon', 'Text': 'A very good, competitive game really enjoyed it.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 44}}, {'Speaker': 'Gordon', 'Text': 'Not as easy as I thought it would be but the three points are the most important thing.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 86}}, {'Speaker': 'Gordon', 'Text': 'Well done Killie and Kettlewell. Bring on Livingston on Wednesday hopefully another three points.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 91}}, {'Speaker': 'Amy', 'Text': 'A long day but an enjoyable one. Young Ben Brannan reminds me of Aaron Hickey - can play RWB or LWB, is comfortable coming inside and taking men on and has a great engine. Hope to see more of him this season.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 175}}, {'Speaker': 'George', 'Text': "Solid start, keep on improving the team's shape and tactics will come together. Good solid signings. Come on the Killie.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 115}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'We asked you for your views as Kilmarnock kicked off the Kettlewell era with victory over Brora Rangers.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 87}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Kilmarnock v Brora Rangers'}]}
